  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A stone is thrown at an angle of 30<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{o}\"></span> to the horizontal. Air resistance is negligible.</p>\n<p>What is correct about the direction of the horizontal and vertical components of the net force (<em>F</em>) acting on the stone when it is at its maximum height?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of horizontal component of </strong><strong><em>F</em></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of vertical component of </strong><strong><em>F</em></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>To the right</td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>To the right</td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
